                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-dotnet/releases/tag/Google.Cloud.BigQuery.Reservation.V1-2.9.0"&gt;Google.Cloud.BigQuery.Reservation.V1 version 2.9.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;New features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add a new field &lt;code&gt;soft_failover_start_time&lt;/code&gt; in the existing &lt;code&gt;replication_status&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;.google.cloud.bigquery.reservation.v1.Reservation&lt;/code&gt; to provide visibility into the state of ongoing soft failover operations on the reservation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add a new field &lt;code&gt;failover_mode&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;.google.cloud.bigquery.reservation.v1.FailoverReservationRequest&lt;/code&gt; that allows users to choose between the HARD or SOFT failover modes when they initiate a failover operation on a reservation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
